{%- comment -%}
  CTA snippet — closing chapter of the long-form description.
  Reads product.metafields.custom.cta JSON:
    {kicker, h2, p, ...}
  Renders kicker + h2 + p only. The "Add to cart" button at the bottom
  was removed (operator preference) — primary CTA lives at the top of
  the product page next to price, duplicating it here was redundant.
  The optional secondary_label / button_label fields in the JSON are
  ignored on purpose.
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- assign cta = product.metafields.custom.cta.value -%}
{%- if cta and cta.h2 != blank -%}
<section class="wanelo-section wanelo-cta">
  <div class="wanelo-cta__inner reveal">
    {%- if cta.kicker != blank -%}<div class="wanelo-kicker">{{ cta.kicker }}</div>{%- endif -%}
    <h2>{{ cta.h2 }}</h2>
    {%- if cta.p != blank -%}<p>{{ cta.p }}</p>{%- endif -%}
  </div>
</section>
{%- endif -%}
